{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26854","headline":"陕下厉玄侍御宅五题 濯缨溪 · 姚合","name":"陕下厉玄侍御宅五题 濯缨溪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧山宁要去，此有濯缨泉。\n晓景松枝覆，秋光月色连。\n行寻屐齿尽，坐对角巾偏。\n寂寂幽栖处，无妨请俸钱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26854.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26854","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}